From c018b76643f94a52eeffde53946d5bf41f33d6cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Deng, Bing" <bing.deng@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:39:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reformat sources to match the project's real clang-format
 style

Super-linter's CLANG_FORMAT validator was failing on these files
because they had never actually been run through amr-common's
Google-based .clang-format config (now wired into the pipeline).
Reformat laserMapping.cpp and preprocess.cpp against it; no logic
changes.

Signed-off-by: Deng, Bing <bing.deng@intel.com>
---
